# Mizano — Cline rules

This file only points Cline-based agents at the maintained instructions; it intentionally duplicates nothing.

1. Read `AGENTS.md` (repository constitution: CPU invoice demo goal, tenant/money/posting rules, review and validation policy).
2. Read `CLAUDE.md` for stack, commands, coding conventions and the CI zero-tolerance policy, then the provider entrypoint for your lane (`CODEX.md`, `GLM.md`, `ANTIGRAVITY.md`).
3. Read `docs/agents/README.md`, `docs/roadmap.md` and your assigned GitHub issue before editing.
4. Reference guides: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/DEVELOPMENT.md`, `docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md`, `docs/strategy/demo-acceptance.md`.

Non-negotiables: scope every query and ID to the authorized organization; Decimal money with decimal-string transport; balanced, transactional, idempotent posting; no auto-posting of uncertain extraction; loading/empty/error states, Arabic/English and RTL in every page; run affected tests plus the full suites before finishing.
